  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Not ‘don’t go back’—go back while advancing. I re-sync my breathing to feeling good and say it to Nei-chan and to myself. Don’t choose fear. Fear narrows the field and steals care.",
    "ja": "「Hibiki、準備を」"
  },
